        "text": {
          "text": "假日同左家人去左淺水灣食飯，去左呢間充滿渡假風情嘅餐廳的食東南亞菜，餐廳有室內和室外坐，我就選擇咗在出面比較寧靜舒適，點左幾樣野食😋😋😋\n\nCrab Meat and Pomelo Salad\nWagyu Beef Satays\nDeep-fried Prawn Cakes\n\nSoup\nTom Yum Kung Spicy prawn soup\n\nMain Courses\nMakhani Murgh\nButter chicken in rich creamy tomato sauce\n\nSalmon Tikka\nStir fries Moming Glory with Chili Shrimp Paste\n\nGarlic Naan\n\nSpices Dessert Platter\nSago pearls in pandan leaf, fresh mango with glutinous rice, rice flour layered cake, pandan coconut ice cream",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
